  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f02-record-formats" name="Choose one adaptive layout for the graph" ecgTitle="Choose one adaptive layout for the graph" ecgDescription="A record uses the actual maximum encoded vertex ID, not a rounded format family. Metadata consumes every remaining bit. H is the bit width of record_count; the largest mantissa m satisfying 2 + 2*H*2^m &lt;= 2^M is selected. Four bytes are tried before the explicit eight-byte escape unless width is forced.">
